+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site id to select its stock; requests without the header use `main`. An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Batch access, stock on hand, cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes are restricted to the selected site. Order receiving requires locations at that site. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
